# UMP2 geometry optimization test for CH3 radical (planar, D3h).
# Verifies that the geometry optimizer correctly dispatches the UMP2
# analytical gradient (rather than silently falling through to the
# pure-UHF branch, which was the v0.62.x behavior).
#
# Expected (StudDFT v0.63.0):
#   Convergence in <= 8 RFO steps.
#   Final E(UMP2/6-31G(d,p), frozen_core=auto): -39.69270453 Ha.
#   Final MP2 correlation:                      -0.12825220 Ha.
#   Optimized geometry: planar D3h, R(C-H) = 1.0743 Angstrom.
#   <S^2> = 0.7612 (mild spin contamination, exact = 0.75).
#
%method        MP2
%basis         6-31G(d,p)
%job           opt
%charge        0
%mult          2
%spin          unrestricted
%print_time

%geo
C   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.000000   1.080000
H   1.020000   0.000000  -0.540000
H  -1.020000   0.000000  -0.540000
